00:00:00.722 --> 00:00:12.278
You can quickly get your products in front of millions of Japanese customers by selling on Amazon

00:00:12.278 --> 00:00:13.000
Japan.

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:19.000
Japan has a population of 128 million people and 70% of them shop online.

00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:22.000
Amazon Japan has millions of customers every month.

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:27.182
In this video, we're going to show you the Amazon tools and services that can help you grow your

00:00:27.182 --> 00:00:28.000
business in Japan.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:33.474
Language support is essential for selling internationally, and we provide expert support throughout

00:00:33.474 --> 00:00:36.000
the entire selling process in Japan.

00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:41.625
From account registration to listing and shipping, you can get support via telephone, chat, and

00:00:41.625 --> 00:00:42.000
email.

00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:47.000
With a professional seller, you get the convenience and efficiency of single sign-on.

00:00:47.000 --> 00:00:52.600
After linking your accounts, you can navigate across multiple marketplaces with one username and

00:00:52.600 --> 00:00:53.000
password.

00:00:53.000 --> 00:00:58.684
You can see all of your accounts within the same region or across different regions with the marketplace

00:00:58.684 --> 00:00:59.000
switcher.

00:00:59.000 --> 00:01:05.000
To learn more about single sign-on, check out the single sign-on video in Seller University.

00:01:05.000 --> 00:01:10.565
After linking your accounts, you can also use the Build International Listings tool, known as BIL,

00:01:10.565 --> 00:01:13.000
to manage your product listings in Japan.

00:01:13.000 --> 00:01:19.069
With BIL, you can add your offers and automatically synchronize the offer prices from, for example,

00:01:19.069 --> 00:01:19.448
Amazon.

00:01:19.448 --> 00:01:24.000
com to Amazon Japan based on the price rules you set up.

00:01:24.000 --> 00:01:29.409
To learn more about how to set up a BIL connection, watch the "Introduction to Build International

00:01:29.409 --> 00:01:31.000
Listings" video in Seller University.

00:01:31.000 --> 00:01:36.000
As with all Amazon marketplaces, product listings must be in the local language.

00:01:36.000 --> 00:01:41.862
To help you quickly list products in Japan and save on translation costs, millions of product detail

00:01:41.862 --> 00:01:46.000
pages in various categories have already been translated from English to Japanese.

00:01:46.000 --> 00:01:53.238
If the product you would like to sell is not currently listed on the Japan marketplace, go to Amazon.

00:01:53.238 --> 00:01:54.000
com/SPN.

00:01:54.000 --> 00:02:00.000
Here, you can find third-party companies on Amazon Solution Provider Network to help you with translations.

00:02:00.000 --> 00:02:06.577
Customers in Japan expect same day or next-day delivery, and using FBA is the best way to satisfy

00:02:06.577 --> 00:02:09.000
this demand and compete successfully in Japan.

00:02:09.000 --> 00:02:15.120
FBA provides customer service on your behalf in Japanese so you can focus on growing your business

00:02:15.120 --> 00:02:18.000
