00:02:18.000 --> 00:02:24.000
When selling in any country, it's important to understand and comply with the local laws and regulations.

00:02:24.000 --> 00:02:30.000
Japan has regulations on many different product categories, mostly for certain grocery, health and

00:02:30.000 --> 00:02:33.000
