00:02:33.000 --> 00:02:38.000
Japan also has special requirements regarding who can import products into the country.

00:02:38.000 --> 00:02:43.100
Amazon knows the territory and can help you learn from our experience in the third-largest economy

00:02:43.100 --> 00:02:44.000
